{"abstract":"The state-of-the-art speech intelligibility tests are created with the purpose of evaluating acoustic communication devices and not for evaluating audio-visual virtual reality systems. This paper present a novel method to evaluate a communication situation based on both the speech intelligibility and the indexical characteristics of the speaker. The results will be available in the final paper. Index Terms: speech intelligibility , virtual reality, body language, telecommunication.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Møller, Anders Kalsgaard","Hoffmann, Pablo F.","Carrozzino, Marcello","Faita, Claudia","Avveduto, Giovanni","Tecchia, Franco","Christensen, Flemming","Hammershøi, Dorte"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-078335"],"event":{"end":"2013-09-04","place":"Vienna, at","start":"2013-09-02","title":"4th International Workshop on Perceptual Quality of Systems","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Italy"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Laboratorio de Robotica Percettiva, TeCIP"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"joint evaluation of communication quality and user experience in an audio visual virtual reality meeting","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://pqs.ftw.at/workshop-program/proceedings/pqs-2013-proceedings/at_download/file","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-078335","ids":["aau-618bf525-a793-40c0-86a5-1027c09b2b25"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-3FFE4411A58992C544B59A3277F35197"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://pqs.ftw.at/workshop-program/proceedings/pqs-2013-proceedings